sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant Client as Client
    participant Router as Router
    participant Redis as Redis

    box WebSocket Service
        participant Manager as Manager
        participant Hub as Hub
        participant Session as Session
        participant Worker as Persist Worker
    end

    participant UserSvc as User Service
    participant ChatSvc as Chat Service
    participant Others as Other Clients

    Note over Client, Others: 1. upgrade 전 등록 준비
    Client->>Router: GET /ws?room_id=R&ticket=T
    Router->>UserSvc: VerifyRoomMember(R, user)
    UserSvc-->>Router: ok
    Router->>Router: owner self-check
    Router->>Manager: PrepareRegister(R)

    alt 기존 Hub 사용
        Manager-->>Router: ready
        Router->>Client: 101 Switching Protocols
        Router->>Manager: Commit(conn, user)
        Manager->>Hub: register session
        Hub->>Session: read/write pump 시작
    else 새 Hub 생성 성공
        Manager->>Redis: acquire wss:room:lease:R
        Redis-->>Manager: success
        Manager->>Hub: 새 Hub 준비
        Hub->>ChatSvc: GetLastSequenceNumber(R)
        ChatSvc-->>Hub: Last Sequence
        Hub->>Redis: GET wss:room:seqfloor:R
        Redis-->>Hub: Sequence Floor
        Hub->>Hub: Start Sequence = max(DB last, Floor)
        Manager->>Hub: Hub actor start
        Manager-->>Router: ready
        Router->>Client: 101 Switching Protocols
        Router->>Manager: Commit(conn, user)
        Manager->>Hub: register session
        Hub->>Session: read/write pump 시작
    else Sequence 초기화 실패
        Manager->>Redis: acquire wss:room:lease:R
        Redis-->>Manager: success
        Manager->>Hub: 새 Hub 준비
        Hub->>ChatSvc: GetLastSequenceNumber(R)
        ChatSvc-->>Hub: error 또는 Last Sequence
        Hub->>Redis: GET wss:room:seqfloor:R
        Redis-->>Hub: error 또는 Sequence Floor
        Hub-->>Manager: ErrRoomSequenceUnavailable
        Manager->>Redis: release wss:room:lease:R<br/>best effort
        Manager-->>Router: ErrRoomSequenceUnavailable
        Router-->>Client: 503 Retry-After: 1
    else Lease busy 또는 Handoff 중
        Manager-->>Router: ErrBusy / Handoff
        Router-->>Client: 503 Retry-After: 1
    end

    alt 동일 사용자 세션이 존재하는 경우
        Hub->>Session: conflict 메시지
        Session->>Client: close old connection
    end

    Note over Client, Others: 2. persistent chat message hot path
    Client->>Session: chat(content, client_msg_id)
    Session->>Session: validation + rate limit
    Session->>Hub: publish
    Hub->>Hub: client_msg_id dedupe
    Hub->>Hub: reserve persist slot

    alt persist queue full
        Hub-->>Session: transient error
        Note over Hub: sequence 증가 없음<br/>fan-out 없음
    else slot reserved
        Hub->>Hub: sequence_number++
        Hub->>Worker: persist task enqueue
        loop room sessions
            Hub->>Session: fan-out
            Session->>Others: send
        end
        Worker--)ChatSvc: BatchCreateMessages
        ChatSvc--)Worker: ack / duplicate result
        Worker--)Hub: task ack<br/>pendingPersist--
    end

    Note over Client, Others: 3. 연결 해제와 idle cleanup
    Client->>Session: close
    Session->>Hub: unregister
    Hub->>Session: close session

    alt 마지막 세션 종료 후 idle timeout
        Hub->>Hub: beginDrain
        Hub-->>Manager: done
        Manager->>Redis: release lease if token matches
    end
